      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b5e925/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-11T12:17:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Check out the Rules and Clarifications guide: <a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/sotm_rules_and_clarifications.pdf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/sotm_rules_and_clarifications.pdf</a></p><p>On page 2:</p><blockquote><p>Cards are still in play while they’re resolving their own destruction<br>Effects on cards which are being destroyed are still in play until the destruction is complete.</p></blockquote><p>So yes, this means that Mountainous Carapace still grants the -1 damage, since it's not actually destroyed until the damage has been dealt.</p>",
